            "1 Kauh thangc bammei aniu Pu Ravguangc )}3",
            "Kalat Baibal khou zianpui lat dinclou;",
            "Ch’rynpui tuang ’peyna Baibal khou how e,",
            "Jisu ata zianmei hei ch’ryn liang e.",
            "",
            "Ai neihlaa e, Jisu )}3 zian e!",
            "Jisu zian e, ata zian e;",
            "Ai neihlaa e, Jisu )}3 zian e!",
            "Ata nganvna zian e!",
            "",
            "2 Ai Kata ’mucsuina ruan duc sihni,",
            "Thangc 3)^ nganvna Kamei ata zian e,",
            "Jisu ata zianmei ningtow pwkhou,",
            "Ai guang dat re, zianpui baancpwam bangc khou!",
            "",
            "3 Guangh daihmeipu ramgai 3)^ how pwkhou,",
            "Ai lu khat na suanlou khang nai ethei,",
            "Mi hei tingsaengzaeng alu sw puni:",
            "“Adih ch’ryn cho, Jisu ata zianmei!”",
            "",
            "4 Jisu ata zianmei hei ai thay the,",
            "Zianpui zaeng ata thuaklou khang key e,",
            "Zianpui zaeng )}3 kros ruc khou theiclou the,",
            "Ai thay ’than the, Jisu ata zianmei!",
            "",
            "5 Jisu zianloumei khou ai zaeng ’thaekc ge,",
            "Lwmloumei paan ata suaihiam lou the,",
            "Seitaan pingna akhou )}3 pak tat re,",
            "“Jisu )}3 ata zian e,” saa pwkhou."
